Package: nonraid-tools
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 5.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: NonRAID array management tools Debian Package
 Installs nmdctl, legacy compatibility units, scheduled parity and notification
 units, and the NonRAID udev rule without enabling or starting array ownership.
